      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You can throw yourself away from a dangerous position and take flight. You Step and Stride, or Stride and Step. If you aren’t already in @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.ancestries.w5uNwdtMEYnNSHM8]{Hovering Stance}, you enter it in-between your two move actions. All movement during Launching Hover follows the similar benefits and limitations that Hovering Stance grants you when taking these actions, and you gain a +2 circumstance bonus against reactions during your movement.</span></p>"
